            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "Vindicator: Uprising is a platform shoot 'em up with pixel graphics and an epic soundtrack. Shoot your way through nine hardcore action levels with fast, responsive gameplay and unique challenging levels. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has specially written orchestral music for each level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe player character is a special agent for an organization called “The Order” that rules the world in league with the “Angels”. The Angels are a mysterious ancient race, mercenaries which sought to conquer the earth and made a pact with the emerging organization. The player discovers the hidden truths that the Order uses for world domination. He then turns against his “Order” and leads earth’s resistance as a “Vindicator” with his arcane knowledge to oppose the Angels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a new revamped version of Vindicator: Uprising. This version features a more balanced difficulty level, player achievements and other improvements. The old Windows version can still be downloaded for free at our website.",
            "about_the_game": "Vindicator: Uprising is a platform shoot 'em up with pixel graphics and an epic soundtrack. Shoot your way through nine hardcore action levels with fast, responsive gameplay and unique challenging levels. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has specially written orchestral music for each level.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe player character is a special agent for an organization called “The Order” that rules the world in league with the “Angels”. The Angels are a mysterious ancient race, mercenaries which sought to conquer the earth and made a pact with the emerging organization. The player discovers the hidden truths that the Order uses for world domination. He then turns against his “Order” and leads earth’s resistance as a “Vindicator” with his arcane knowledge to oppose the Angels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a new revamped version of Vindicator: Uprising. This version features a more balanced difficulty level, player achievements and other improvements. The old Windows version can still be downloaded for free at our website.",
            "short_description": "Vindicator: Uprising is a platform shoot 'em up with pixel graphics and an epic orchestral soundtrack.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>idiomas com suporte total de áudio",
            "reviews": {
                "query_summary": {
                    "num_reviews": 1,
                    "review_score": 0,
                    "review_score_desc": "9 user reviews",
